<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-metering-quota> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Evaluate current entitlement and the exact zero-paid ceiling before reservation or counting; bind reservations and usage events to idempotency keys, explicit windows and signed adjustments, include projected usage before calls, and reconcile an uncertain prior invocation before retry. Missing, ambiguous or degraded usage state remains unknown and cannot authorize spend or fabricate zero usage." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
