<urn:usf:acceptance:provider-adapter-preflight> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "The exact selected adapter is content verified and the scrubbed child proves fixed-origin, selected-variable-only, bounded zero-paid request construction before any authenticated answer request." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
